  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Fry the spices, tomato paste and crushed garlic in a pot."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the uncooked pasta and stir. Add the water, chilli (halved), lemon juice and zest, and celery. Bring to the boil and cover."
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce the heat and cook the soup for 20 minutes, stirring occasionally so the pasta does not stick to the bottom. If it needs more liquid, add another cup of water."
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately with half a lemon on the side, before the pasta absorbs too much liquid."
    }
